### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8081/health

### Create Product
POST http://localhost:8081/api/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sample Product",
  "description": "A test product",
  "price": 19.99,
  "stock": 100,
  "category": "test"
}

### Get All Products
GET http://localhost:8081/api/api/products

### Get Product by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/api/api/products/1

### Update Product
PATCH http://localhost:8081/api/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Product",
  "price": 24.99
}

### Delete Product
DELETE http://localhost:8081/api/api/products/1
